00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:53.600
<v Sean>So we me and my stepbrother would would do that.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.720
<v Sean>Then Madden 08.

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:06.520
<v Sean>I probably played a franchise for 15, 16 in game years and move some teams around.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:08.600
<v Sean>It was really funny. I had a team in Mexico City.

