<v Sean>I had a team in Calgary.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:17.320
<v Sean>Then I think those are the three like formative sports games.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:24.200
<v Sean>Everything since that PS2 Xbox era has just been kind of whatever.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:27.080
<v Mike>I think it's a I think it's a solid draft.

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:32.140
<v Mike>And, you know, working off of what we're you know, what is a sports game?

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:43.180
<v Mike>What isn't and iconic ones I tend to pick is like my favorite sports games, even even though there are actual simulation ones like pick any year of the show, probably.

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:50.660
<v Mike>And I think it's, you know, an amazing experience or we were talking about and we have mentioned so many times NFL 2K5.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:55.860
<v Mike>That's the ESPN one where you can also like build a house or an apartment.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.560
<v Mike>I forget. You can decorate a crib.

