<v Mike>The same thing with was MVP baseball 2005 where you can just like set the price on concessions, but also be the batters and play the game at the same time as running the franchise.

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:18.580
<v Mike>All those things are fun.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:29.800
<v Mike>But I think the best sports video games in my head, the ones that like I go back to and keep playing are the ones that make the sport more exciting than real life.

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:35.580
<v Mike>Like the Sims stuff does a great job of making me feel like I'm in the shoe of those athletes.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:36.660
<v Mike>But it doesn't.

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:38.360
<v Mike>Just one shoe. Yeah.

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:39.300
<v Mike>I can't wear both shoes.

